-- The duty in (b)(i), as a regulative rule: the claimant, once the Court has so ordered, must serve within 14 days.
DECLARE `o 9 r 5(1)(b) party` IS ONE OF
    `o 9 r 5(1)(b) the claimant`

DECLARE `o 9 r 5(1)(b) act` IS ONE OF
    `o 9 r 5(1)(b)(i) serve the originating process`

