-- src:754 | serve the originating process within 14 days after the date of the first case conference; or
@ref O 9 r 5(1)(b)(i) (src:753-754)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `o 9 r 5(1)(b) party` `o 9 r 5(1)(b) act`
`o 9 r 5(1)(b)(i) the claimant must serve the originating process` MEANS
    PARTY `o 9 r 5(1)(b) the claimant`
    MUST `o 9 r 5(1)(b)(i) serve the originating process`
    WITHIN 14
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `o 9 r 5(1)(b) the claimant` BECAUSE "the originating process was not served within 14 days after the date of the first case conference"

