    IF `the request was made by letter`
    THEN
        CONSIDER way
        WHEN `o 9 r 9(9) deal with the request summarily` THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN `o 9 r 9(9) fix a case conference to deal with the matter` THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the request by letter"; a scope limit with no "only" (ruling of 2026-11-05, (c))

-- src:844 | (10) No application may be taken out during the period starting 14 days before the commencement of the trial and ending when the Court has determined the merits of the action, except in a special case and with the trial Judge’s approval.
